  "name": "5-Week Full Body Strength Block",
  "summary": "This block shifts the emphasis toward strength while keeping enough hypertrophy work to maintain and build muscle. The three days remain full-body, the main lifts use lower rep ranges and longer rest periods, arm and shoulder accessories use time-efficient supersets, and Week 5 is a planned deload at about 90% of the most recent normal working load with reduced sets. Seated Leg Curl is standardized across Workouts A and C so it shares one exercise history.",
  "weeks": 5,
  "deloadWeek": 5,
  "deloadLoadFactor": 0.9,
  "deloadSetRule": {"4":3,"3":2,"2":1,"1":1},
